node signs | Sign assignments | finite ±1
node sums | Block sums | S_A, S_B
node parity | Parity of m | even: zero allowed | odd: away from zero
node spectral | Spectral coords | parity restriction
node constraint | Constraint | y+z_sp ≥ d_m | d_m=0 or 2/m
node covariance | Covariance class | implementable
edge signs -> sums
edge parity -> sums
edge sums -> spectral
edge parity -> spectral
edge spectral -> constraint
edge constraint -> covariance
